{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'python3 /workspace/tools.py read paper:dmr --lines 20'","aggregated_output":"/bin/bash: warning: setlocale: LC_ALL: cannot change locale (C.UTF-8)\n/bin/bash: warning: setlocale: LC_ALL: cannot change locale (C.UTF-8)\n{\n  \"id\": \"paper:dmr\",\n  \"url\": \"https://ojs.aaai.org/index.php/AAAI/article/view/5346\",\n  \"version\": \"content-sha256:656c9e5eec79c9843e907a555ede2bf0a66a0db3515916af3d655080057c5a75\",\n  \"access_scope\": \"author README only, not the blocked publisher paper\",\n  \"text_sha256\": \"656c9e5eec79c9843e907a555ede2bf0a66a0db3515916af3d655080057c5a75\",\n  \"total_lines\": 9,\n  \"start_line\": 1,\n  \"next_line\": 10,\n  \"truncated\": false,\n  \"text\": \"1: # DMR\\n2: Deep Match to Rank Model for Personalized Click-Through Rate Prediction\\n3: \\n4: This code for DMR is implemented based on the Alimama Dataset (https://tianchi.aliyun.com/dataset/dataDetail?dataId=56), references the codes of DIEN (https://github.com/mouna99/dien).\\n5: \\n6: \\\"alimama_sampled.txt\\\" is a sampled dataset for testing the code.\\n7: \\n8: Notice that, the user behavior data in this dataset contains only category, brand and behavior type, but no item.\\n9: \"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
